  "title": "Nutritious Rich Ethiopian Lamb Berbere Stew",
  "description": "A rich and flavorful Ethiopian stew made with lamb, berbere spice, and muscovado sugar, slow-cooked to perfection in a claypot.",
  "cuisine": "Ethiopian",
